{
  "id": "JDG.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Balamuji 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni na nkīma wa Timuna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Samsoni ūja Timuna ūūkabona koi nkīma Mfilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washoka ī kaya ūng'wīla ū ise nū nina gīkī, “Napandīkaga nkīma Mfilisiti kū nzengo gwa Timuna, jagi ko mukanilūngīje nantoole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise nū nina būng'wīla, “Batīho a bakīma ū mu banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wing'we, nūūlū ū mu banhū bise a bose, nose ūje ūkatoolele kū Bafilisti banhū batasaalilwe?” Alīyo ū Samsoni ūbawīla gīkī, “Nilūngījagi ū ngw'wenūyo aniigeleelilwe ū nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A babyaji bakwe baalī batamanile ī gīkī, “Ū mhayo gwenūyo gwalī gūfumile kūlī SEEBA, wakoobaga nzīla ya kūbakomya a Bafilisiti, nguno ū mu shikū jenījo baalī babasugile a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Samsoni ūtulumenha ajile ī Timuna hamò nū ise nū nina. Aho beegeela kū migūnda ya mizabibu ya bana Timuna, kwimanīla yansanga shimba īlīpogoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla mu nguzu ningī no, wīdima ī shimba yenīyo wītandūla na makono gaakwe dūhū, gītī munhū akūtandūlaga kaana ka ng'holo. Alīyo ūleka ū kūng'wīla ū ise nūūlū ū nina ū mhayo ūyo akagwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja ūūkahooya nū nkīma ng'wenūyo; ūntogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jaabīta shikū, ūshoka ko hangī kūjūmalīīja kahelele ka nhoola; ūliga kūjūūgūlola ū mimba gwa shimba; ūsanga nzūkī jaateelile mo, jaaswīīlile na būūki ū mu malela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhagūla malela gamò na makono gakwe ūja alīīlya, ūūkabinha na a babyaji bakwe aho wabapandīka ū mu nzīla, nabo būlya; alīyo atabawīlile ū gwa gīkī a malela genayo akagasolela mu mimba gwa shimba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaalaagū ya ng'wa Samsoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ise o ng'wa Samsoni ūja kūnola ū nkīma ūyo alībiza ng'wīnga wakwe. Hūna ū Samsoni ūbeeja shigūūkūlū sha būkombe gīt'ūmo shaalī shīmīle sha ntooji ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika winhwa balūngūnja makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Samsoni wabawīla, “Yīyī kaalaagū namutūūlīle bagosha, ūlū ng'wībbadīja ū ng'wikanza lya shikū mpungatī ja būkwīlīma, nakūng'winha shizwalo makūmi adatū sha kitaani na myenda makūmi adatū ya kwalūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū mulaalemeelwe ū kūniinha ī lishosho ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo, a bing'we hū mukūninha ī shizwalo īsho makūmi adatū sha kitaani, nī myenda ya kwaalūla īyo makūmi adatū.” Nabo būng'wīla, “Alitwinhage ī kaalaagū yako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakoya shikū idatū baalemeelagwa ū kūpandīka ī lishosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū mu lūshikū lwa kanè būng'wīla ū nke o ng'wa Samsoni gīkī, “Bebe nembalembage ū ngoshi wako akwinhe ī lishosho lya lūgano, ūlū ītī chene numho tūkūkūpembeela moto ū bebe nī kaya ya ng'waso muche. Gashi nīyo ng'watwitanile aha kwiza kūtwiba dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nke wakwe ū Samsoni ūng'wigondeela kūnīlīīla alīhaya, “Ū bebe ūnidalahile ī gete, nīyo gashi ūtanitogilwe; a banhū ba lūganda lwane wabinhile lūgano alīyo ū nene ūtaalī nū kūninha ī lishosho!” Nang'hwe ūng'wīla, “Ū baba nū mayū nataalī ū kūbawīla, ū bebe hū nakūwīle?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akanīlīīla ū Samsoni pyī ī likanza lya shikū mpungatī ī ja shigukulu; nose a ha lūshikū ū lwa mpungatī ūng'wīla, nguno akangaagaanīla no. Nang'hwe ūbawīla a banhū bakwe ī lishosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī aho lītaalī kūloka ī līīmi, a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo būng'wīla gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla na nguzu ningī, ūja Ashikeloni; ūūkabūlaga banhū makūmi adatū ba kwenūko. Ūbīngīja ī shikolo shaabo ūūkabinha ī shizwalo abo bakang'winha ī lishosho lya lūgano lwakwe. Hūna wīnga ko wapelanaga no, ūja kū kaya ya ng'wa ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū numa ū nke wakwe ū Samsoni winhwa sūmba ng'wiye, ūyo walī nsheesha wakwe a ha lūshikū lwa kūfumanīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
